{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"﻿﻿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6thシングル「Start over!」\n櫻坂46展「新せ界」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も進み続ける櫻坂が\nツアーファイナルを迎えます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空間を超え、場所を超え、海を超えて\n同じ瞬間を過ごせる興奮で胸いっぱいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ141PCG2SA6P57Z5FMEE07F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ141QBMKWQRYF91JG5KZZGA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミーグリも、お待ちしています\n私とお話してください☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://fortunemusic.jp/sakurazaka_202306/\n(あともう数時間で締め切りです(;_;)気になって下さった方、待ってます…！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝えたい気持ちも、ずっと言いたかった言葉も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつだってすぐに相手に、\nいやあなたに届けられること、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前じゃないなって\n私自身がそう感じているから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切にしたいと思っています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n大阪盛り上がっていきましょーーー❤️‍🔥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい声聞かせてね、\n画面越しからも、いっぱい愛届けてね＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ141RCX80H2NYV6Z8VXT450","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#今日のリハ着\n#大勢は塩"}],"source":"archive"}